ges of Designing a Website to Buy Instagram Followers\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 768px, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2F%D9%88%D8%A8-%D8%B3%D8%A7%DB%8C%D8%AA.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2F%D9%88%D8%A8-%D8%B3%D8%A7%DB%8C%D8%AA.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2F%D9%88%D8%A8-%D8%B3%D8%A7%DB%8C%D8%AA.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2F%D9%88%D8%A8-%D8%B3%D8%A7%DB%8C%D8%AA.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2F%D9%88%D8%A8-%D8%B3%D8%A7%DB%8C%D8%AA.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2F%D9%88%D8%A8-%D8%B3%D8%A7%DB%8C%D8%AA.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2F%D9%88%D8%A8-%D8%B3%D8%A7%DB%8C%D8%AA.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2F%D9%88%D8%A8-%D8%B3%D8%A7%DB%8C%D8%AA.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2F%D9%88%D8%A8-%D8%B3%D8%A7%DB%8C%D8%AA.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"prose-blog mt-8\" dir=\"ltr\"><h3>Hello</h3>\n<h3>Buying and selling virtual services is profitable, and I have experience with it</h3>\n<h4>The size of two companies can have income</h4>\n<h3>Even though we think setting up a WordPress website takes only a few minutes, and that's exactly right</h3>\n<h3>But setting it up and customizing it is very time-consuming</h3>\n<h3>If the site is routine and ordinary, it might be possible to wrap it up in one or two weeks</h3>\n<h3>But when the site becomes specialized, the work becomes much more difficult and specialized</h3>\n<h3>WordPress is a very popular system</h3>\n<h3>With WordPress, many plugins can be added to give the website more features</h3>\n<h3>Sometimes these plugins are not compatible with each other, so we are forced to install and test different plugins</h3>\n<h3>Sometimes plugins no longer offer newer versions and are not compatible with the newer version of WordPress</h3>\n<h3>Customizing the theme also has its own headaches</h3>\n<h3>But overall, because there are abundant themes and plugins for WordPress, and many other designers encounter similar problems, solutions are usually found</h3>\n<h3>One of the current problems is finding good hosting</h3>\n<h3>Honestly, if there were no sanctions, there would be many good foreign hosting options available, but now we have to search extensively to find good hosting at a reasonable price</h3>\n<h3>When you do find affordable hosting, either the hardware is not new and up-to-date, or the software features are not complete</h3>\n<h3>For example, I got hosting from ParsPack, and we talked a lot about needing a certain software feature</h3>\n<h3>I wanted the cron job wget to work</h3>\n<h3>After I purchased it and saw that a part of it wasn't working, what the hosting company said was incorrect, and the cron job works differently</h3>\n<h3>Now I'm in the process of switching hosts</h3>\n<h3>Honestly, domestic hosting is very expensive. I looked at the Persian Tools website, and their prices are even higher than in the US and Western Europe</h3>\n<h3>Or companies like Iran Server and others were the same (I searched through many hosting websites)</h3>\n<h3>I had hosting from three different places and decided to move to one hosting provider</h3>\n<h3>For now, I'm talking with Net Afraz. Previously, their hosting speed would drop, and they didn't use advanced hardware</h3>\n<h3>If they used SSD or NVME hard drives, I would be more at ease because they have good support and good prices, of course, compared to other sites, most companies are expensive compared to international ones</h3>\n<h3>They have a DirectAdmin control panel, while most companies use cPanel, which is more popular</h3>\n<h3>Now, a stress I have is that I want to transfer applications to the new hosting, and I hope they work</h3>\n<h3>Let's move on. Designing a WordPress website that offers social media services and allows me to sell products from Instagram and other networks like Twitter and Telegram has taken a lot of time so far, even though many things and templates were ready</h3>\n<h3>I wanted the website to be such that when a customer enters an order, it is done automatically. For example, when an order for one thousand Instagram followers is placed, the customer only needs to enter their ID, then it is checked for correctness, payment is made or deducted from their wallet, and an automatic order is sent to the server to be executed</h3>\n<h3>The next task for the <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d9%be%d8%b1%d9%88%da%98%d9%87-%d8%b7%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%ad%db%8c-%d8%b4%d9%87%d8%b1-%d9%87%d9%88%d8%b4%d9%85%d8%a7%d9%86%d8%af/\" rel=\"noopener\">website</a> is SEO, which is really time-consuming, but very important</h3>\n<h3>Either a lot of advertising needs to be done for the website, which is costly, or we need to do good SEO and do some advertising to get the site to generate sales</h3>\n<h3>Effective content is very important, and I'm working on it</h3>\n<h3>Producing content is very time-consuming, and creating some initial pages and content sometimes took me a day</h3>\n<h3>Of course, once sample pages are created, we can copy from them later, which takes less time</h3>\n<h3>Overall, designing the site structure is time-consuming and may change multiple times over time</h3>\n<h3>Designing the user interface for the website definitely requires creativity, but feedback that we later get from users and the ease or difficulty that can even be obtained through software can help us improve the user interface</h3>\n<h3>For the website design, the important part was that users could find our services and products from anywhere</h3>\n<h3>First, I designed many buttons, but I saw it was too cluttered. After a while, I found a WordPress plugin called superfly that could help and build buttons and a menu to assist users, but I still think a better plugin could have helped, but I couldn't find one</h3>\n<h3>For the payment gateway, it's not much of a challenge, and there are various options. I preferred to use ZarinPal</h3>\n<h3>The next challenge I have is changing the website theme's language and being able to add other languages to it</h3>\n<h3>For now, that's all the time I've had to write. I hope it has been helpful to you</h3>\n<h3></h3>\n<h3>Thank you</h3>\n<h3></h3>\n<h3>Mehrdad</h3>\n<h3>Short Link:<br />\n<a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/cas3\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>https://mehrdad.ir/cas3</strong></a></h3></div><aside aria-label=\"Ready to turn this into a product?\" class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-violet-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-600/10 to-fuchsia-600/10 p-5 sm:p-6\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-violet-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"></path><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path></svg>Ready to turn this into a product?</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">In one AI MVP Sprint I take your idea from first sketch to a live product — in weeks, not months.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-fuchsia-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:from-violet-700 hover